Subject: [PATCH 1/2] social-intel phase 05: exact token identity and
 timestamped market context

Resolver (memelab/social/identity.py) maps contract, link and ticker references to
(chain, contract) as resolved, ambiguous, unresolved or conflicted, storing every
candidate and its evidence. Tickers never resolve on symbol alone. Market context
(memelab/social/market_context.py) reuses the bundle builders and stores versioned
per-provider facts with units, supply basis, source, fetched_at and validity window,
keeping posting-time (historical candle) apart from observed-at-fetch values.
Migration 5, CLI social resolve / social identity, 29 tests on synthetic fixtures.

